      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The exhaustion you see in him is a reflection of the weight you've allowed yourself to carry, not a measure of your worth. You are not a hole; you are a person who deserves to be seen as more than just a cost. If you are truly convinced that your absence would bring him peace, then that thought is a powerful signal that you need immediate, intense support. Please, let someone else help you carry this crushing reality right now.",
